<title>USA: Group cuts stake in Chemi-Trol Chemical.</title>
<headline>Group cuts stake in Chemi-Trol Chemical.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Trilon Dominion Partners L.L.C. said Monday it cuts its stake in Chemi-Trol Chemical Co to 241,351 common shares or 12.04 percent from 15.3 percent previously.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 65,000 common shares on September 27 in a brokered transaction.</p>
<p>Gross proceeds from the sale was $710,937.</p>
<p>Other members of the group include VC Holdings Inc, Ronald W. Cantwell, Dominion Capital Inc and Dominion Resources Inc.</p>
</text>
